[agent:result] stdout: Note: This API reference documents APIs for the Workspace Model Registry.
[agent:result]   Databricks recommends using [Models in Unity
[agent:result]   Catalog](/api/workspace/registeredmodels) instead. Models in Unity Catalog
[agent:result]   provides centralized model governance, cross-workspace access, lineage, and
[agent:result]   deployment. Workspace Model Registry will be deprecated in the future.
[agent:result] 
[agent:result]   The Workspace Model Registry is a centralized model repository and a UI and
[agent:result]   set of APIs that enable you to manage the full lifecycle of MLflow Models.
[agent:result] 
