[agent:result]   temporary-path-credentials             Temporary Path Credentials refer to short-lived, downscoped credentials used to access external cloud storage locations registered in Databricks.
[agent:result]   recipient-activation                   The Recipient Activation API is only applicable in the open sharing model where the recipient object has the authentication type of TOKEN.
[agent:result]   recipient-federation-policies          *Public Preview* The Recipient Federation Policies APIs are only applicable in the open sharing model where the recipient object has the authentication type of OIDC_RECIPIENT, enabling data sharing from Databricks to non-Databricks recipients.
